# Normalise line endings: store text as LF in the repo (correct for the Linux
# Render build), check out native on each OS. Prevents spurious CRLF diffs.
* text=auto

# Explicitly treat known binaries as binary (never touch their bytes).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.Z binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
